@startuml sequencia-agentes-sda
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderThickness 1
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #666
skinparam participantPadding 12
skinparam boxPadding 10

title **SDA - Sequência Completa dos Agentes**\n(Aquisição de Instruções → LangGraph → Output)

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
' PARTICIPANTES
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

actor "Usuário" as User #LightBlue
participant "React UI\n(CopilotKit)" as UI #LightCyan
participant "Next.js API\n/api/copilotkit-supervisor" as CopilotRoute #LightYellow
participant "Supervisor BFF\n/api/supervisor-bff" as BFF #Gold
participant "Cockpit MCP Server\n(mcp-agent.br.avanade.ai)" as MCP #LightGreen
participant "Azure OpenAI\n(GPT-4o)" as LLM #Salmon
participant "Sub-Agente\n(Team Member)" as SubAgent #Plum
participant "MCP Tools\n(Externos)" as MCPTools #LightPink

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
' FASE 1: INICIALIZAÇÃO E AQUISIÇÃO DE INSTRUÇÕES
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

== 1. INICIALIZAÇÃO — Carregamento do Supervisor ==

User -> UI : Seleciona supervisor\ne envia mensagem
activate UI

UI -> CopilotRoute : POST /api/copilotkit-supervisor\n{agent: "supervisor_agent",\nproperties: {utilityAgentId, mcpHeaders}}
activate CopilotRoute

note right of CopilotRoute
  **CopilotRuntime** instancia
  **LangGraphHttpAgent** apontando
  para /api/supervisor-bff
end note

CopilotRoute -> BFF : POST /api/supervisor-bff\n(RunAgentInput — AG-UI Protocol)
activate BFF

note right of BFF
  Extrai contexto MCP de
  **forwardedProps**:
  - mcpServerUrl
  - mcpHeaders (apiKey, licenseId,
    namespaceId, utilityAgentId)
  - user_intent (se houver)
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
' FASE 2: CARREGAMENTO DO SUPERVISOR VIA MCP
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

== 2. AQUISIÇÃO DE INSTRUÇÕES — MCP JSON-RPC 2.0 ==

BFF -> MCP : **callMCPTool**("inspect_agent")\n{utility_agent_id: supervisorId}
activate MCP
note right of MCP
  **JSON-RPC 2.0** via HTTP POST
  Headers: x-api-key, x-cockpit-license-id,
  x-cockpit-namespace-id
end note

MCP --> BFF : Supervisor Data:\n- instruction (system prompt)\n- team[] (lista de agentes)\n- artifacts_catalog[]\n- mcp_connections[]
deactivate MCP

note right of BFF #LightYellow
  **Frontmatter Parser** extrai config YAML:
  ```
  ---
  temperature: 0.7
  outputMode: full_history
  handoffStrategy: delegate
  ---
  ```
  **resolveArtifacts()** substitui
  ${KEY} placeholders por valores
  do artifacts_catalog
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
' FASE 3: CARREGAMENTO DO TIME
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

== 3. CARREGAMENTO DO TIME ==

loop Para cada agente no team[]
  BFF -> MCP : **callMCPTool**("inspect_agent")\n{utility_agent_id: agentId}
  activate MCP
  MCP --> BFF : Agent Data:\n- name, description\n- instruction (prompt do agente)\n- artifacts_catalog[]\n- routing_keywords[]
  deactivate MCP
end

note right of BFF #LightYellow
  Agentes típicos carregados:
  ● **Discovery Analyst** — Project Brief
  ● **Product Advisory** — PRD
  ● **Backlog Engineer** — Épicos/Stories
  ● **UX Advisor** — Design/Wireframes
  ● **Tech Advisory** — Arquitetura
end note

BFF --> UI : SSE: STEP_STARTED("load_team")\nSSE: CUSTOM("team_loaded", {agents})
note left of UI : UI exibe indicadores\nde progresso do time

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
' FASE 4: CARREGAMENTO DE FERRAMENTAS MCP
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

== 4. CARREGAMENTO DE MCP TOOLS ==

BFF -> MCP : **callMCPTool**("list_tools")\n(para cada mcp_connection)
activate MCP
MCP --> BFF : Tools disponíveis:\n- create_artifact, update_artifact\n- search_artifacts, rag_search\n- custom tools por conexão
deactivate MCP

note right of BFF #LightYellow
  **4 categorias de tools criadas:**
  1. **Delegation Tools** — transfer_to_<agent>
  2. **MCP Platform Tools** — create/update/search artifacts
  3. **HITL Tools** — ask_user, confirm_action
  4. **Frontend Tools** — CopilotKit actions (canvas)
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
' FASE 5: CONSTRUÇÃO DO PROMPT DO SUPERVISOR
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

== 5. META-PROMPTING — Construção do System Prompt ==

note right of BFF #Gold
  **BFFPromptBuilder** monta o prompt:
  
  1. **Identidade** — Nome e papel do supervisor
  2. **Seção do Time** — Lista cada agente com:
     - Nome, descrição, routing keywords
     - Tipos de artefato que produz
  3. **Regras de Delegação**:
     - Analisa user_intent para pré-routing
     - Mapeia intenções → agentes especialistas
  4. **Regras HITL** (Human-in-the-Loop):
     - Quando pedir confirmação ao usuário
     - Limites de autonomia
  5. **Canvas Protocol**:
     - Instruções para escrita de documentos
  6. **Histórico** — Mensagens anteriores da thread
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
' FASE 6: LOOP AGÊNTICO — LLM + TOOLS
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

== 6. LOOP AGÊNTICO — Supervisor Reasoning ==

BFF -> LLM : **invoke()** com:\n- systemPrompt (meta-prompted)\n- messages[]\n- tools[] (delegation + MCP + HITL + frontend)
activate LLM
LLM --> BFF : AIMessage com tool_calls[]:\n[{name: "transfer_to_discovery_analyst",\nargs: {user_input: "..."}}]
deactivate LLM

BFF --> UI : SSE: TEXT_MESSAGE_START\nSSE: TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT (chunks)\nSSE: TOOL_CALL_START("transfer_to_...")

note right of BFF #Gold
  **Loop de até 10 iterações**
  while (iteration < MAX_ITERATIONS):
    response = LLM.invoke(messages + tools)
    if no tool_calls → stream text, break
    for toolCall in response.tool_calls:
      execute tool
    messages += [aiMsg, ...toolResults]
    if HITL tool → pause, wait user
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
' FASE 7: DELEGAÇÃO AO SUB-AGENTE
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

== 7. DELEGAÇÃO — Execução do Sub-Agente ==

BFF -> MCP : **callMCPTool**("execute_agent")\n{utility_agent_id: targetAgentId,\nuser_input: delegatedTask}
activate MCP
activate SubAgent

BFF --> UI : SSE: CUSTOM("subagent_delegation_started",\n{agentName, agentId})

note right of SubAgent #Plum
  **Sub-agente executa internamente:**
  1. Recebe instrução + contexto delegado
  2. Pode chamar tools MCP próprias
  3. Pode fazer múltiplas iterações
  4. Gera resposta/artefato
end note

SubAgent -> MCPTools : Usa ferramentas de sua\nmcp_connection (se houver)
activate MCPTools
MCPTools --> SubAgent : Resultado da ferramenta
deactivate MCPTools

MCP --> BFF : Resultado do sub-agente:\n{response, artifacts_created[]}
deactivate SubAgent
deactivate MCP

BFF --> UI : SSE: CUSTOM("subagent_delegation_completed",\n{agentName, result})\nSSE: TOOL_CALL_RESULT

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
' FASE 8: CONTINUAÇÃO DO LOOP (OPCIONAIS)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

== 8. CONTINUAÇÃO — Supervisor Processa Resultado ==

BFF -> LLM : **invoke()** com resultado\ndo sub-agente adicionado\nao histórico de mensagens
activate LLM

alt Supervisor decide delegar a outro agente
  LLM --> BFF : tool_calls: [transfer_to_<outro_agente>]
  BFF -> MCP : execute_agent (outro agente)
  MCP --> BFF : Resultado
else Supervisor usa ferramenta MCP diretamente
  LLM --> BFF : tool_calls: [create_artifact / rag_search]
  BFF -> MCP : callMCPTool (ferramenta)
  MCP --> BFF : Resultado
else Supervisor pede input do usuário (HITL)
  LLM --> BFF : tool_calls: [ask_user]
  BFF --> UI : SSE: CUSTOM("hitl_request",\n{question, options})
  note left of UI #LightCyan
    UI exibe modal/prompt
    para o usuário responder
  end note
  User -> UI : Responde pergunta
  UI -> BFF : Resume com resposta do usuário
else Supervisor finaliza resposta
  LLM --> BFF : Resposta final (sem tool_calls)
end

deactivate LLM

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
' FASE 9: OUTPUT — Streaming de volta ao usuário
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

== 9. OUTPUT — Resposta Final ==

BFF --> UI : SSE: TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT (resposta final)\nSSE: TEXT_MESSAGE_END\nSSE: CUSTOM("run_metrics",\n{tokens, duration, iterations})\nSSE: RUN_FINISHED
deactivate BFF

CopilotRoute --> UI : Stream SSE fechado
deactivate CopilotRoute

note left of UI #LightCyan
  **CopilotKit processa AG-UI events:**
  - TEXT_MESSAGE → renderiza no chat
  - TOOL_CALL → mostra indicadores
  - CUSTOM (subagent_*) → progresso
  - CUSTOM (run_metrics) → métricas
  - Artefatos → Canvas/Preview
end note

UI --> User : Exibe resposta\ncom artefatos e métricas
deactivate UI

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
' NOTAS ADICIONAIS
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

note over User, MCPTools #FFFACD
  **Fluxos Alternativos:**
  
  ● **SDA2 (LangGraph Supervisor nativo):**
    Frontend → /api/sda2-bff → get_agent_card (MCP) → createSupervisor (@langchain/langgraph-supervisor)
    → ReactAgent por membro → transfer_to_<agent> → SSE AG-UI
  
  ● **Legacy SDA (Streaming direto):**
    Frontend → /api/sda-agents → SDA_AGENTS[agentType] → Azure OpenAI streamText()
    → SSE data chunks → useSDAChat hook
  
  ● **CopilotKit CoAgent (LangGraph StateGraph):**
    Frontend → CopilotRuntime → StateGraph(load_supervisor → chat ⇄ tools → END)
    → MemorySaver checkpointer → copilotkitEmitState
end note

@enduml
